Package: ontologyConnectR
Title: Live Source Connectors for Ontology Object Types
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Ontology", "Developer", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "dev@example.com")
Description: Backs ontology object types against live external sources
    (REST APIs, FHIR R4, JDBC databases, GraphQL) using a DBI/dbplyr
    backend architecture. Queries translate in real time to the source's
    native query language. Integrates with objectSetsR as a drop-in
    replacement for DBI-backed tables via the LiveConnection S4 class.
Depends: R (>= 4.1)
Imports:
    DBI,
    methods,
    rlang (>= 1.0.0),
    cli (>= 3.0.0),
    cachem (>= 1.0.0),
    httr2 (>= 1.0.0)
